# plasma6-wallpapers-komplex
## [1.0.7] - 2025-11-04
### Added
- Komplex Packs: Rhodium Liquid Carbon, Root Sanctum, Warp Tunnel, The Universe Within, Sailing Beyond, Mist Part 2, Shimmy, The Grid, Neonwave Sunset
- Manipulative Shaders: ASCII, Aberrating Aberrations, Brannan Filter, Chroma Blur, Circular Pixels, Color Invert, Color Reduction, Desaturate, EGA, Fake Thermal, Gameboy, Gaussian Blur, Heartfelt, Italic, Median (Fast), Melting Snow, Mirrors (Top, Right, Bottom & Left), Nearest Neighbor, Night Vision, Oil Panting, Old Memory, Perlin Noise, Pixelation, Posterize, Quadtree, Radial Blur, Rain Drops, Rainbow, Randomized Transitions, Ripple Distortion,
Scatter Blur, Sepia, Soft Blur, Solarize, Stone Man, Video Artifacts, Video Bubble, Video Glitch 2, Video Wall, Water Ripples

### Changed
- Launched stop-gap replacement for ShaderToy API that will act as a holdover until the official API is back online
- Default location for simple shader selector. Will now sort manipulative shaders instead

### Fixed
- Framerate limiting bug introduced in 1.0.5. Video playback now functions with frame rate limiting.
- Bug related to channel blending mode
- Reduced channel samples
